{{Passive skill box|Blood Magic}}

'''Blood Magic''' (often referred to as '''BM''') is a [[keystone passive skill]] that changes all [[mana]] [[cost]]s and [[reservation]]s to [[life]] costs and reservations. It also grants more maximum life and removes your mana.

==Mechanics==
Skills that reserve mana will reserve life and skills that cost mana will cost life instead. This change applies after ''base'' mana cost modifiers (e.g. [[Divine Blessing Support]], [[The_Lake_of_Kalandra#Reflecting_Mist|Inverted]] [[Elreon, Light's Judge|Elreon's]] jewellery), but before other mana-specific cost or reservation modifiers (e.g. {{c|mod|#% increased/reduced Mana Cost of Skills}}, {{c|mod|+# to Total Mana Cost of Skills}}, {{c|mod|#% increased/reduced Mana Reservation Efficiency of Skills}}), which will have no effect on the new life cost or reservation. 

It is not possible to commit suicide through Blood Magic. 

If taken with {{psl|Eldritch Battery}}, your energy shield will continue to protect mana but will not be spent.

While you have Blood Magic, you are neither at full mana nor low mana.<ref name="Bloodmagiclowmana"/>

Taking this keystone along with {{psl|Sanguimancy}} from [[Warlock of the Mists]] will provide the {{c|mod|50% increased Life Reservation Efficiency of Skills}} stat, but otherwise impart no additional benefit.

==Location==
Blood Magic is located in the bottom left corner of the tree.

